 alt=\"waa wei 魏如萱。(胡凱欣 攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148112866499366912547631.jpeg/4AsgycKBlrPv3x_mi8YEe0uT6sOYTgJ9jYANMreADTI\"/><figcaption>waa wei 魏如萱。(胡凱欣 攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"廿四味與馮德倫。(胡凱欣 攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148113357765611520763094.jpeg/BLsOzpMhUQE-5A2ae9dLK95RufiIBHbMROCFFH7ghRQ\"/><figcaption>廿四味與馮德倫。(胡凱欣 攝)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T09:42:11.706013+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1197,"images":25,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}